# Glance Reply backend — example env. Copy to .env for local dev:
#   cp .env.example .env   (then fill in real values)
#
# Real values live in the environment ONLY — never commit them, never
# paste them in chat, never put them in app.json or any repo file.
# The bot token comes from @BotFather; the Groq key from console.groq.com.
# Both are handed over via the Secure Vault flow at sprint start.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
GROQ_API_KEY=
